      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Freedom%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Freedom sits on the Ohio River, 25 miles northwest of Pittsburgh, and is part of the Pittsburgh metropolitan area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Freedom%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1896, Freedom merged with neighboring Clair and Vicary boroughs to form a single municipality.",
